"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Door_Open_Close","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The manager storms out of the room."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Phew, the Earl's name does come in handy."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"KH2002","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Khaybar","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...It's a double-edged sword. We should keep a lower profile."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"As for you..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Commander looks at Morridow, who has been sitting quietly and demurely on the chair throughout the whole exchange."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You just stay here."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Morridow","expression":8,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"spritePosition":"0,90"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Morridow","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Whatever you say."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"We need someone to coordinate with us at the control room. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It can't be anyone else but M4, and since M4 is staying, so are you."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"M4 is about to say something, but thinks the better of it. She simply nods."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"RO635Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":"RO635","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'm staying too."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"To everyone's surprise, RO635 raises a hand."}]}